  "bodyHash": "7EGZ0eYCvaE=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046268316192865/image.png?ex=66cf60d7&amp;is=66ce0f57&amp;hm=1f135ae0c58bf2b8a3e9680ceb4fa688ab95027b2557b7adf965fbd5b70bc7eb&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組只添加了我另一個模組「<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">七宗罪</span>」中的武器和盔甲套裝。該模組已內建更好的戰鬥相容性。此模組主要為了那些想使用武器和盔甲，但不需要頭目和結構的玩家而設計。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新增了一個名為<strong>「<span style=\"color:#3598db\">暗鋼升級模板</span>」</strong>的物品，你主要將透過這個物品來製作大部分武器和所有盔甲套裝。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c97e1873-a4a9-44fa-891b-9f1088e6a2ac.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">大部分配方與原始模組相似，只是現在加入了這個物品用於製作。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_93bb3863-2bea-4fc4-9957-fb93358273c4.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">現在要獲得精華，無需擊敗相對應的頭目，只需將<span style=\"color:#169179\">終界之眼</span>和相應的物品在工作台中合成即可，如下所列。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">怠惰：任何羊毛</span><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">暴食：生牛肉</span><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">色慾：罌粟</span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">貪婪：金錠</span><br><span style=\"color:#169179\">嫉妒：綠寶石</span><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">憤怒：火藥</span><br><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">傲慢：不死圖騰</span><br>暴行：地獄之星</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">至於<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">3把特殊武器</span>，它們可以從特定生物身上掉落獲得。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">脊骨劍：凋零骷髏</span><br><span style=\"color:#169179\">石製巨劍：衛道士</span><br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">龍之刃：劫毀獸</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046464228069506/image.png?ex=66cf6106&amp;is=66ce0f86&amp;hm=6641225d2dd2a3896029e94a720b2968d0363b603ab0fa3745c29af004534d5f&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.discordapp.com%252fattachments%252f1019298883282673674%252f1277362873848565790%252fimage.png%253fex%253d66cce461%2526is%253d66cb92e1%2526hm%253d4d186caf88fa5ff65d8e93742a23ebc865fb9387c81268cc543bb3894997bbf3%2526\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1019298883282673674/1277362873848565790/image.png?ex=66cce461&amp;is=66cb92e1&amp;hm=4d186caf88fa5ff65d8e93742a23ebc865fb9387c81268cc543bb3894997bbf3&amp;\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1019298883282673674/1277363160684171296/image.png?ex=66cce4a5&amp;is=66cb9325&amp;hm=69dfc5ec3f706b251e0de5dbbacec7d1d54c5800a5857c72984edfc430046805&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046620662890606/image.png?ex=66cf612b&amp;is=66ce0fab&amp;hm=7bdef18aba4f4f9249bdd71bdc69b85cee468daa09e16d621f6a682afa32ca3a&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046720327946240/image.png?ex=66cf6143&amp;is=66ce0fc3&amp;hm=466088db3c914027570b046f79c78e214aeffb7bc13b22104e453f7a4ca198dd&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046843120521226/image.png?ex=66cf6160&amp;is=66ce0fe0&amp;hm=d3ea74b23ed36197b1f1c9a98bc37fb07e48b908580a5a7a9e0c315a0eff327e&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278046919884542032/image.png?ex=66cf6172&amp;is=66ce0ff2&amp;hm=a4d2dea16fbdea7a75c6c9d943d764b66491b01955a43dfdf0a03456ddc629cb&amp;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fasto566554\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278047061736161290/image.png?ex=66cf6194&amp;is=66ce1014&amp;hm=b28800e5813f2fbf210417911c49101cf6f7a9cdec04c7302d60869c93cb3cd6&amp;\"></a></p>",
